<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>Driver checklist · D’ RAW</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="/warehouse-ui.css"><style>body{margin:0;padding:20px;font:16px system-ui;background:#fff4e8;color:#251044}main{max-width:1300px;margin:auto}a{color:#411575}button,select,input{font:inherit;padding:11px;border:1px solid #d4c3e7;border-radius:12px;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box}button{background:#411575;color:white;cursor:pointer;min-height:44px}button:disabled{opacity:.5}button.secondary{background:#eee5fa;color:#411575}.toolbar{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center;flex-wrap:wrap}.savebar{position:sticky;top:0;background:#fff4e8;padding:12px 0;z-index:4;border-bottom:1px solid #dfd2eb;margin:12px 0}.filters{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(180px,1fr) minmax(170px,240px);gap:15px}.filters label{display:block}.filters input,.filters select{display:block;width:100%;margin-top:6px}.product{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) minmax(200px,340px);gap:18px;align-items:center;background:white;padding:18px;border:1px solid #dfd2eb;border-radius:15px;margin:10px 0}.product small{display:block;color:#655474;margin-top:6px}.product select{width:100%}.notice{white-space:pre-wrap;font-weight:650}.pill{display:inline-block;background:#eee5fa;padding:7px 12px;border-radius:15px}.unavailable{color:#a64b13;font-size:13px}.pagination{margin:20px 0}[hidden]{display:none!important}@media(max-width:600px){body{padding:12px}.product{grid-template-columns:1fr}.filters{grid-template-columns:1fr}}</style></head><body><main><nav><a href="/workspaces?workspace=management">← Management</a> · <a href="/warehouse-planning">Route planning</a></nav><h1>Driver checklist</h1><p>Choose which products appear on the printed loading checklist at the front of each route invoice bundle. Quantities are totaled across stops, keeping different case sizes separate.</p><p>Defaults include 